Protocol references (documented, not vendored)
----------------------------------------------
The packet IDs, registry codecs, and wire-format behaviour implemented here
were derived by reading the public documentation and reference
implementations listed in docs/research/limbo-references.md (among them
NanoLimbo, PicoLimbo, and minecraft-data). No third-party source code was
copied into this repository.

